WEBVTT

00:02:56.573 --> 00:03:01.799
And at least 40 patients
are expected to go to a PHC every day.

00:03:02.673 --> 00:03:06.760
But in Rajasthan,
only one out of four PHCs

00:03:06.784 --> 00:03:09.450
was seeing this minimum
number of patients.

00:03:09.474 --> 00:03:13.455
In other words, people
had lost faith in the system.

00:03:15.352 --> 00:03:17.519
When we delved deeper,

00:03:17.543 --> 00:03:22.209
we realized that lack of accountability
is at the core of it.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:24.660
Picture this.

00:03:25.153 --> 00:03:27.804
